			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120460201,
					"content": "瑞希，我们来预约下次的心理诊疗服务了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460202,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "百日白白音"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460203,
					"content": "真难熬…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴葉紫"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460204,
					"content": "欸？这是怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460205,
					"content": "一觉醒来，就变成了这个样子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蓝川丞"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460206,
					"content": "…是很严重的消化不良。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460207,
					"content": "啊？难道白音和阿紫昨晚吃了很多噩梦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460208,
					"content": "#不会吧？昨天登记的客人除了{NICKNAME}和派蒙，就只剩下两个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蓝川丞"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460209,
					"content": "那两个人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460210,
					"content": "那两个人的噩梦有问题，影响食梦貘消化的因素除了噩梦的数量，还有噩梦的强度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460211,
					"content": "这种强度的噩梦，根本不是正常人应该有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460212,
					"content": "呕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "百日白白音"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460213,
					"content": "如果不能帮她们尽快消化噩梦的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460214,
					"content": "接下来需要做什么？我们可以帮忙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460215,
					"content": "必须先找到那两名客人，了解他们产生噩梦的原因，我才能帮助白音和阿紫消化噩梦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460216,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙，你们昨天和他们交流过，有把握找到他们吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460217,
					"content": "嗯…对了，他们说还要再找「江村一玄斋」接受一次指导，今天可能还会去那个地方！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120460218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120460218,
					"content": "请带我去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "梦见月瑞希"
				}
			]
		},
